flowchart TB
    R[Researcher<br/>question / hypothesis] --> C[Contract<br/>scope • safety • evidence • acceptance]
    C --> E[Experiment Recipe YAML<br/>agent-neutral source of truth]
    E --> A[Primary Agent<br/>Goose reference • other validated adapters]

    subgraph HOST[Mandatory Host Layer]
      H1[Goose]
      H2[Lima + QEMU]
      H3[LiteLLM + OmniRoute]
      H4[Numbat + Aegis + Phoenix/OTel + ClawMetry]
      H5[Research / forensic tools]
      H6[Host YAML recipes + install.sh]
    end
    H6 --> H1
    H6 --> H2
    H6 --> H3
    H6 --> H4
    H6 --> H5
    A --> HOST

    A --> S[Native multiagent / subagent delegation]
    S --> ROLES[Specialist roles<br/>planner • researcher • runtime • forensics • detection • verifier • reporter]
    A --> X[Lima VM + instrumentation profile]
    ROLES --> X
    X --> W[Recipe-defined workload<br/>executed by agent inside VM]
    W --> EV[Evidence + session.yaml]
    EV --> AN[Evidence analysis / forensics]
    AN --> V[Independent verification]
    V --> RP[Research report<br/>report.md + report.yaml]
    RP --> P[Preserve hashes / provenance]
    P --> D[Destroy disposable VM]
    RP --> L{Learning enabled?}
    L -- No --> END[Complete]
    L -- Yes --> LW[Retrieve → propose → execute → evaluate → refine → replay]
    LW --> IV[Independent verification]
    IV --> HA[Human approval]
    HA --> PR[Promote approved skill]
    PR --> END
    CU[Container Use<br/>optional additional isolation] -. optional .-> X
